// Title: Invoke-Obfuscation CLIP+ Launcher
// ID: b222df08-0e07-11eb-adc1-0242ac120002
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Jonathan Cheong, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-13
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Detects Obfuscated use of Clip.exe to execute PowerShell
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "cmd") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "&&") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "clipboard]::") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "-f")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/c") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/r")))
